{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Independent nonauthor merged-SHA review receipt, part 3/6 (24 rows; 142 total). Reviewer session: resume-group03-20261023. Immutable before: b65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd. Reviewed signed candidate: b46efb88356c0d78ee726007b12a62d4feae6ffe. Exact Gerrit 3096 merged SHA: 5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89. All 28 grouped changed path blobs, including generated docs/env-vars.md, are byte-identical candidate→merged. Every selected row has directives, semantic preservation, and bloat removal PASS with a strict word reduction. Complete 142-row TSV SHA-256: 02e042abbe56804e72d174b1f2b63f9a826f37affa92238e25552c9aef9ec1e9.\n\n```tsv\nstable_block_id\tbefore_citation\tfinal_citation\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tdirectives_exact\tbefore_words\tafter_words\tsemantic-preservation\tbloat-removal\treviewer_session\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::C:module@204-210\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:204-210\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:119-120\tScrub token query values before access-log formatting while preserving routes and other query fields. Headers avoid request-line tokens.\tPASS\t92\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::D:TokenRedactingFilter@222-230\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:222-230\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:132-133\tReplace query-token values in a log record's string args and message before formatting. Always pass the redacted record onward.\tPASS\t90\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::D:install_access_log_redaction@244-249\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:244-249\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:147-149\tInstall the token filter once on uvicorn.access. Header authentication avoids request-line logging. The deployed Gerrit webhook uses query-token authentication, so this filter protects it.\tPASS\t61\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::C:ReceiverConfig@295-304\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:295-304\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:195-197\tHold the reconciler cursor behind retryable candidates, but no more than 24 hours behind the newest event. An expired holdback emits RECONCILE_DEGRADED so the stuck change stays visible.\tPASS\t133\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/config.py::C:ReceiverConfig@308-312\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:308-312\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/config.py:201-202\tFetch the tickets branch from the GitHub mirror beside the Gerrit change clone. Gerrit does not host this orphan branch.\tPASS\t64\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py::D:module@1-29\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:1-29\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:1-4\tPublish review findings in Gerrit messages and optional inline comments. The message enumerates findings even when file anchors are unavailable or inline posting fails. Valid revision paths may also receive inline comments. The adapter shares this module's rendering for blocking and advisory text.\tPASS\t289\t43\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py::C:module@50-52\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:50-52\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:25-25\tKeep shared message-detail and item-count limits for both finding kinds.\tPASS\t42\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py::D:parse_anchor@64-74\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:64-74\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:37-39\tParse a finding location into path and optional line. Use the same rule as the review-result parser without importing its agents dependency.\tPASS\t97\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py::D:partition_findings@91-97\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:91-97\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:56-57\tSeparate findings with a numbered path in the revision file map from those that belong in the message body. Invalid paths cannot break a vote.\tPASS\t75\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py::C:module@109-112\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:109-112\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:69-70\tAccept raw kernel findings and translated receiver findings when rendering message text or inline comments.\tPASS\t53\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py::D:_standing_suffix@120-123\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:120-123\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:78-78\tMark a finding carried from an earlier patchset, or return empty text.\tPASS\t52\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py::D:render_findings_block@141-147\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:141-147\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:96-98\tRender up to MAX_ITEMS findings with criterion, detail, and location. Add an overflow note. Empty input returns an empty string. Blocking format remains compatible with the adapter's prior output.\tPASS\t55\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py::D:build_inline_comments@162-167\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:162-167\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:113-114\tBuild resolved Gerrit comments for already validated finding anchors. Advisory comments never leave unresolved threads that block submission.\tPASS\t51\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py::D:post_review@205-213\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:205-213\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/finding_publish.py:152-155\tPost the vote with optional inline findings and return its HTTP status. If inline posting fails, retry message-only with all findings and a publication notice. A closed-change 409 or failure without inline comments remains terminal.\tPASS\t106\t35\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:module@1-22\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:1-22\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:1-5\tStdlib Gerrit REST and git client for review-bot operations. Authenticated /a/ calls use basic auth and strip Gerrit's XSSI prefix. The client reads patches, revision files, votes, messages, and events, posts reviews or comments, tags and submits changes, and fetches a review checkout. The async voter offloads its blocking calls.\tPASS\t189\t50\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::C:module@44-58\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:44-58\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:27-28\tBound every git call to 300 seconds for cold clones. Network fetches also abort when throughput stalls, without interrupting slow progress.\tPASS\t189\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:_git_op@71-75\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:71-75\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:41-42\tReturn the git subcommand from list or string timeout arguments. Skip global -C options and fall back to git.\tPASS\t53\t19\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:GerritClient.get_patch@145-151\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:145-151\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:112-113\tReturn format-patch text from XSSI-prefixed JSON, decoding base64 if present. Also accept a base64 text/plain body.\tPASS\t64\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::C:GerritClient@175-183\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:175-183\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:137-139\tReview merge conflict resolutions through the auto-merge file delta. Bare /patch returns 409 and first-parent diff includes the full feature. Synthetic paths are not conflict files.\tPASS\t106\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:GerritClient.get_merge_files@193-197\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:193-197\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:149-151\tReturn a merge revision's delta against Gerrit's auto-merge base. A clean merge contains only pseudo-paths. Bare /patch returns 409 for merge revisions.\tPASS\t59\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:GerritClient.get_revision_files@201-207\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:201-207\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:155-157\tReturn the revision file map used to validate inline finding paths. For merges, the same endpoint without base or parent yields the auto-merge delta.\tPASS\t80\t24\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:GerritClient.has_llm_review_vote@226-231\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:226-231\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:176-177\tReturn whether any account has a nonzero LLM-Review vote on this revision. Gerrit-side state complements local deduplication.\tPASS\t51\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:GerritClient.reset_llm_review_vote@244-250\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:244-250\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:190-192\tReset this bot's vote to neutral on the exact revision. The fixed message and value create a durable rerun event without accepting contributor-controlled vote text.\tPASS\t58\t25\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\nsrc/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py::D:GerritClient.get_change_event@267-273\tb65dc0c825274676a0957c57a703b1fc17e83ddd:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:267-273\t5830c2f2c284a7ff488f436528f7dd7dde295e89:src/rebar/review_bot/gerrit_client.py:209-210\tBuild a webhook-shaped manual-rerun event for the current revision. Return None when Gerrit reports no current revision.\tPASS\t59\t17\tPASS\tPASS\tresume-group03-20261023\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792822752617563533,"uuid":"d09537c5-d5a0-44b1-ae8b-4db7b58217aa"}